---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="图片来源" titleEn="Image credits">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-12 sm:py-20">
    <div data-lang="zh">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">图片来源</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          首页封面为以下四张图片的拼贴，仅做裁剪、亮度/色彩微调与排版。四张图片分别对应航天遥感、深空探测、高能激光和大型望远镜应用场景。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">航天遥感 / Landsat 9</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">NASA/Goddard Space Flight Center/Conceptual Image Lab，公有领域。图为 Landsat 9 任务示意图。</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LANDSAT-9.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">维基共享资源 ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">大型望远镜 / ESO Extremely Large Telescope</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">ESO（欧洲南方天文台），CC BY 4.0。图为 ESO 极大望远镜艺术效果图。</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Extremely_Large_Telescope_(artist%E2%80%99s_rendering)_(elt_1_cc_sm_001).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">维基共享资源 ↗</a>
          <a class="mt-2 ml-4 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CC BY 4.0 ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">深空探测 / Webb's First Deep Field</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">NASA、ESA、CSA、STScI，公有领域。</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Webb%27s_First_Deep_Field.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">维基共享资源 ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">高能激光 / National Ignition Facility</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory / National Ignition Facility，公有领域。图为 NIF 的 192 束高能激光汇聚到靶室中心。</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NIF_implosion_converging_beams.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">维基共享资源 ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-gray-500">研究方向页配图均为项目实验室实拍，不使用第三方素材。</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">中文字体：标题使用系统黑体（SimHei / PingFang SC），正文使用系统宋体（STZhongsong / Songti SC）；英文字体：MiSans（Apache License 2.0）。如用于正式发布，建议在项目致谢或成果页同步保留上述来源与许可信息。</p>
    </div>

    <div data-lang="en">
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Image credits</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-gray-600">
          The homepage cover is a collage of four images. They were cropped, slightly adjusted for brightness and colour, and arranged; the image content was not altered.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Spaceborne remote sensing / Landsat 9</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">NASA/Goddard Space Flight Center/Conceptual Image Lab, Public Domain. Landsat 9 mission illustration.</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:LANDSAT-9.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Large telescope / ESO Extremely Large Telescope</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">ESO (European Southern Observatory), CC BY 4.0. Artist's rendering of the ESO Extremely Large Telescope.</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:The_Extremely_Large_Telescope_(artist%E2%80%99s_rendering)_(elt_1_cc_sm_001).jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons ↗</a>
          <a class="mt-2 ml-4 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">CC BY 4.0 ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">Deep-space exploration / Webb's First Deep Field</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">NASA, ESA, CSA, and STScI, Public Domain.</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Webb%27s_First_Deep_Field.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons ↗</a>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-white border border-gray-100 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900">High-energy laser / National Ignition Facility</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory / National Ignition Facility, Public Domain. NIF's 192 high-energy laser beams converge at the centre of the target chamber.</p>
          <a class="mt-2 inline-block text-sm text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:NIF_implosion_converging_beams.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Wikimedia Commons ↗</a>
        </article>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-10 text-sm text-gray-500">Research-direction images are photographs of the project laboratory and use no third-party material.</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-500">Chinese typefaces: system sans for headings (SimHei / PingFang SC) and system serif for body (STZhongsong / Songti SC); English typeface: MiSans (Apache License 2.0). For formal publication, retain the source and licence information on the project acknowledgements or outputs page.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
